<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#223341; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;" class="em_green"> 
<div id="text_01" class="mktoText"> 
<p style="text-align: center;">Success is attributed to positive experiences. As an organization that prides itself on being experience-centric, we believe adding value in the moment for current and future users is what takes traditional 'support' functions to the next level.<br /><br /></p> 
<p style="text-align: center;">In our&nbsp;<span style="color: #48b985;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/delivering-valuable-experiences-three-ways-to-ensure-success-at-every-step-of-the-support-journey?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" style="color: #48b985;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">latest blog</span></strong></a></span>, Jon Stamper, Flywire's Director of Client &amp; Payment Experience, describes three ways Flywire works to ensure valuable support experiences.</p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
