<div id="text_013" class="mktoText"> 
<p><span style="font-size: 18px;">In our latest on-demand webinar, learn how you can prepare for the NACHA Account Validation Rule and additional changing regulations that lie ahead.<br /><br /><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #48b985;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/webinar-recording-what-you-need-to-know-nacha-account-validation-rule?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" style="color: #48b985; text-decoration: underline;">View the webinar</a></span></span><br /></span></p> 
